"edu.kde.org/kgeography</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"តំបន់​បណ្ដាញ ៖ <ulink url=\"http://kgeography.berlios.de/\">http://kgeography."
"berlios.de/</ulink> និង <ulink url=\"http://edu.kde.org/kgeography\">http://"
